                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Like Before\n\nWhen we studied the Etruscan-Roman numbers between 1 (I) and 10 (X), we learned that, in the middle of the way, there was the number 5 (V).\n\nNow we will do something similar with the numbers between 10 (X) and 100 (C): in the middle of the way, there is the number 50 (L).\n\nLook at the two lines below. The first shows the path from 1 to 10, and the second shows the path from 10 to 100:",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p data-custom=\"etruscan-roman-tens-path\"></p>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "*Figure 1: The symbol in the middle of each path: V between I and X, and L between X and C.*",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "47de1b22-6adf-41dc-af34-7a2984aabcdb",
         "prev": "",
