               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Between X and XX\n\nThe logic we used between 1 (I) and 10 (X) also works between 10 (X) and 20 (XX). The main difference is that now we keep X ahead of the other symbols to show that we are counting tens.\n\nSee the numbers from 10 to 20:",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p data-custom=\"etruscan-roman-tens-table-10-20\"></p>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "*Table 1: The numbers from 10 to 20.*",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "5d1d8648-932a-467e-9929-49f31643ae1a",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "5d1d8648-932a-467e-9929-49f31643ae1a",
