               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Nothing Changes, Except...\n\nWe use the same logic for the numbers between the other tens, but we must pay attention to one detail. First, look at the table below:",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p data-custom=\"etruscan-roman-tens-table-30-40-50\"></p>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "*Table 2: The tens 10, 20 and 30, followed by 40 and 50.*",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "83d6ca90-1ae4-4c89-aa5a-4485673f9d2a",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "83d6ca90-1ae4-4c89-aa5a-4485673f9d2a",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "thinking",
         "source_menu": [],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Let Us Think!\n\nOn the previous screen, we wrote 40 as XL instead of IL.\n\nIs this the correct way to represent 40?",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "09fe0c29-2dce-4cf8-9732-620a230fa70f",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": "yes",
         "score": 2,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "09fe0c29-2dce-4cf8-9732-620a230fa70f",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "happy",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "07666919-8290-4aee-a9fd-af148508f754",
               "text": "Original Text",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=class_content&arg=07666919-8290-4aee-a9fd-af148508f754",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            },
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "a372974f-4cea-4702-852d-40e70e155583",
               "text": "Wheelock, F. (ed. R. LaFleur)",
               "page": "https://www.csun.edu/~hcfll004/latin-numbers.html",
