         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Conclusion\n\nIn this class, we learned how to write the numbers between 10 and 99 — the tens. We saw that the way we fill the space between two tens (X...XX, XX...XXX, ..., XC...C) follows the same idea we learned in another class, but this time we must use more symbols.\n\nWhen a symbol is placed before a larger one, we subtract 10; otherwise, we add 10.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
